scenario costly_repairs over surprises
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
  note "Co jeśli naprawa kosztuje dwa razy więcej? Te same losowania co w surprises (adresy nie nazywają scenariusza), więc różnica jest liczona parami."

ask check_no_repair: check (abs(share(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises} == 0) - oracle_share[no_repair]) <= oracle_share_tol[no_repair]) == true in costly_repairs law 2026-10-19 random at quantile(0.5) paths 1000 seed 7

ask check_paired_mean: check (abs(mean(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises}) - oracle_value[paired_mean]) <= oracle_value_tol[paired_mean]) == true in costly_repairs law 2026-10-19 random at quantile(0.5) paths 1000 seed 7

ask check_paired_median: check quantile(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises}, 0.5) == oracle_value[paired_median] in costly_repairs law 2026-10-19 random at quantile(0.5) paths 1000 seed 7

ask paired_cost: quantile(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises}, 0.5), mean(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises}), share(net_worth_on[2027-12-31] - net_worth_on[2027-12-31] as if {scenario surprises} == 0) in costly_repairs law 2026-10-19 random at quantile(0.5) paths 1000 seed 7

version costly_repairs_cost
  cite modeller
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-10-19
  replace repair_cost = 6000 assumed "scenariusz: naprawa za 6 000 zł zamiast 3 000 zł"
